  "summary_text": "Short call with Nimbus Health's CIO. The board froze all new IT projects until the January budget review, so the 6 November demo is cancelled and no new date was agreed. The budget itself is unchanged at 90k USD a year.",
  "summary_markdown": "Short call with Nimbus Health's CIO. The board froze all new IT projects until the January budget review, so the 6 November demo is cancelled and no new date was agreed. The budget itself is unchanged at 90k USD a year.",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Hi Roberto, good morning. Pedro is with me. We wanted to go through the plan for Friday's demo with the clinic managers.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:30:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:30:18Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Roberto Lima"
      },
      "text": "Morning, both. I'm glad you called, because I have news, and it isn't good. The board froze all new IT projects until our budget review in January.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:30:21Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:30:31Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "I see. So Friday's demo...",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:30:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:30:42Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Roberto Lima"
      },
      "text": "Please cancel the demo on Friday. There is no next step from our side for now, and nothing has been agreed beyond waiting for the budget review.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:30:43Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:30:53Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Pedro Almeida"
      },
      "text": "Understood. Should we keep a placeholder in the calendar, maybe for December?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:31:05Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:31:10Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Roberto Lima"
      },
      "text": "No, please drop it. I can't commit to any date, not even a date to talk again.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:31:12Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:31:19Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Roberto Lima"
      },
      "text": "To be clear, the budget itself hasn't changed: it's still ninety thousand dollars a year. It's the timing that moved.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:32:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:32:38Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "That's clear. Is there anything we can send that would help with the budget review?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:34:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:34:46Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Roberto Lima"
      },
      "text": "Not really. If the board approves the budget in January, I'll reach out to you.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:34:48Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:34:54Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Pedro Almeida"
      },
      "text": "Thanks for being upfront with us, Roberto.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:35:02Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:35:05Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Roberto Lima"
      },
      "text": "Of course. I'm sorry about the timing. Take care, both of you.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:38:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:38:35Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "You too, Roberto. Thanks, bye.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T12:38:38Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T12:38:40Z"
    }
  ]
}
